| `project/shared/company.gate` | Who may do what |
| `project/shared/office.cal` | The business days |
{{if temporal}}
| `project/shared/pay.flow` | The steps of the payment |
{{end}}
| `go/`, `requests/` | What ritsu makes from `project/`. Do not change it by hand |
| `generate.go` | The command `go generate` runs, which makes `go/` and `requests/` again |
| `{{package_file}}` | What the project gives the server: the code that was made, the organization's data, the permissions, and the part that sends notices |
| `gate.go`, `notify.go` | The part that answers for the permissions, and the part that sends notices |
{{if mcp}}
| `tools.go` | The agents' tools at `/mcp` of the server |
{{end}}
{{if temporal}}
| `flows.go` | What starts the payment on Temporal, and the workers that run it |
